time Action

scale slot 12s 6
row block
zoom 0-2

box proposer [icon: user]
box block [icon: box]

step Act
  say act shows what a box does by itself, in the small text under it.
  act proposer: build a block

step Hand over
  say Draw a line after the action, and what it made reaches the next box.
  proposer -> block [at: 0]
  now -> 0
